{"id":"n36741-1-11","stage":5,"title":"국방 · 国防","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36741-1-11-1","ko":"요즘 이웃 나라 어부들이 우리 영해에 들어와 고기잡이를 한다고 합니다.","zh":"据说最近邻国的渔民进入了我们的领海捕鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"이웃","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}},{"text":"나라","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}},{"text":"어부들이","meaning":"渔夫","explanation":"어부：渔夫；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어부","audio":"/audio/11feb1c23a1891f87a23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67010","senseId":"1","lemma":"어부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어부들이","audio":"/audio/b80c70981d699dabd7d8.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"영해에","meaning":"领海","explanation":"영해：领海；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"영해","audio":"/audio/363e37c0a2fbaf210498.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22005","senseId":"1","lemma":"영해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영해에","audio":"/audio/c5a75fdfb8f381cc2fb6.mp3"}},{"text":"들어와","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어와","audio":"/audio/39338ada1cc6f37987a3.mp3"}},{"text":"고기잡이를","meaning":"捕鱼，打鱼","explanation":"고기잡이：捕鱼，打鱼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고기잡이","audio":"/audio/5ffea51a43f7d26a12db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28086","senseId":"1","lemma":"고기잡이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고기잡이를","audio":"/audio/09f3f3fa86e5002f9bb0.mp3"}},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한다고","audio":"/audio/4ffc62f5a7d10aa4f9f6.mp3"}},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합니다","audio":"/audio/ba3bd059cedb445814a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"11feb1c23a1891f8","term":"어부","zh":"渔夫","audio":"/audio/11feb1c23a1891f87a23.mp3","entryId":"67010","definition":"以捕鱼为职业的人。","pronunciation":["어부"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"363e37c0a2fbaf21","term":"영해","zh":"领海","audio":"/audio/363e37c0a2fbaf210498.mp3","entryId":"22005","definition":"一个国家主权管辖下的海洋领域。","pronunciation":["영해"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"5ffea51a43f7d26a","term":"고기잡이","zh":"捕鱼，打鱼","audio":"/audio/5ffea51a43f7d26a12db.mp3","entryId":"28086","definition":"抓鱼。","pronunciation":["고기자비"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/260946b13ba6dd4984fd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36741-1-11-2","ko":"사소한 일 같아 보여도 제대로 단속하지 않으면 국방에 문제가 생길 수 있으니 엄정 대처해야 하겠네요.","zh":"虽然看起来是小事，但如果不对他们进行严格管控，可能会对国防造成威胁，所以必须采取严厉措施。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사소한","meaning":"琐碎，微不足道","explanation":"사소하다：琐碎，微不足道；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사소하다","audio":"/audio/86943da70fd4b6e6fb42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15881","senseId":"1","lemma":"사소하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사소한","audio":"/audio/2a03e5e307b6b1647207.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"같아","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"보여도","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여도","audio":"/audio/9142e617884b2c18280d.mp3"}},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"正常地，正规地","explanation":"제대로：正常地，正规地","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}},{"text":"단속하지","meaning":"管制，查处，严打","explanation":"단속하다：管制，查处，严打；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"단속하다","audio":"/audio/1c4b7f6a3d1775a43c3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42208","senseId":"2","lemma":"단속하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단속하지","audio":"/audio/d0049fd430ceb26557d1.mp3"}},{"text":"않으면","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않으면","audio":"/audio/d096a85957f74d1fe3b5.mp3"}},{"text":"국방에","meaning":"国防","explanation":"국방：国防；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"국방","audio":"/audio/49bb033b393de85ba758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36741","senseId":"1","lemma":"국방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국방에","audio":"/audio/79ab861cc266234a88a2.mp3"}},{"text":"문제가","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제가","audio":"/audio/2c69fc4d7301d4e27b45.mp3"}},{"text":"생길","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생길","audio":"/audio/820f5004d36d82f13eb8.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니","audio":"/audio/ef60efcf38deedc61094.mp3"}},{"text":"엄정","meaning":"严正","explanation":"엄정：严正","readings":[{"term":"엄정","audio":"/audio/baf41d144b7bd414bec7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27634","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄정","audio":"/audio/baf41d144b7bd414bec7.mp3"}},{"text":"대처해야","meaning":"对付，应付，应对","explanation":"대처하다：对付，应付，应对；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"대처하다","audio":"/audio/1cd60c6867ec633c4258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14355","senseId":"1","lemma":"대처하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대처해야","audio":"/audio/59771ceaecfc835b85a8.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠네요.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠네요","audio":"/audio/9aaf3b38abb3239e1793.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86943da70fd4b6e6","term":"사소하다","zh":"琐碎，微不足道","audio":"/audio/86943da70fd4b6e6fb42.mp3","entryId":"15881","definition":"十分小而细碎，毫不重要。","pronunciation":["사소하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"正常地，正规地","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"以正确格式或标准、样子。","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"1c4b7f6a3d1775a4","term":"단속하다","zh":"管制，查处，严打","audio":"/audio/1c4b7f6a3d1775a43c3a.mp3","entryId":"42208","definition":"加以控制，以免违反法律、规定、命令等。","pronunciation":["단소카다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"49bb033b393de85b","term":"국방","zh":"国防","audio":"/audio/49bb033b393de85ba758.mp3","entryId":"36741","definition":"保卫国家安全，不受他国侵略或威胁。","pronunciation":["국빵"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"